OL,3,ABurnham to unveil public body to invest
OL,4,Ain electricity grid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is expected to announce a
OL,7,Fnew government body to invest in
OL,8,FBritain's electricity grid in his first
OL,9,Fparty conference speech as Labour
OL,10,Fleader on Tuesday.
OL,12,FThe prime minister will tell party
OL,13,Factivists in Liverpool that the new
OL,14,Fpublicly owned company, branded Great
OL,15,FBritish Grid, will speed up grid
OL,16,Fhook-ups by driving up competition for
OL,17,Fconnection projects.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
