OL,3,AFive men arrested in RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aincident released on police bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men who were arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof terrorism offences near RAF Fairford
OL,8,Fare being released on police bail,
OL,9,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,11,FA major incident was declared and
OL,12,Fdozens of homes were evacuated after
OL,13,Fpolice were alerted to three
OL,14,F"suspicious vehicles" near the airbase
OL,15,Fin Gloucestershire in the early hours
OL,16,Fof Sunday morning.
OL,18,FCounter Terrorism Policing (CTP) said
OL,19,Fofficers were exploring "multiple lines
OL,20,Fof inquiry", including whether proxies
OL,21,For individuals working on behalf of a
OL,22,Fforeign state were involved.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
